            <ArticleTitle>Primary prevention of allergic diseases: current concepts and mechanisms.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>105-13</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1186/1710-1492-3-4-105</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>: Atopic diseases, the new &quot;epidemic of the twenty-first century&quot; and a central health problem of industrial nations, call for the development of innovative primary prevention strategies. The present review provides an overview of current experimental and immunomodulatory procedures and their underlying mechanisms.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
